msgid "IPv6 双栈"
msgstr "IPv6 Dual Stack"

msgid "接口与报文"
msgstr "Interfaces and Packets"

msgid ""
"IPv6 与 IPv4 共用描述符、等待队列、权限和网络执行上下文。应用使用 Linux x86-64 socket ABI 和 POSIX socket 调用，不需要 ReliefNT 私有 "
"IPv6 调用。 ``AF_INET6`` 为 10，``sockaddr_in6`` 大小为 28 字节；地址和端口为网络字节序， ``sin6_scope_id`` 是接口索引。当前 "
"``lo`` 为 1，``eth0`` 为 2。 链路本地地址需要正确的区域标识。"
msgstr ""
"IPv6 shares descriptors, wait queues, permissions, and the network execution context with IPv4. "
"Applications use the Linux x86-64 socket ABI and POSIX socket calls, without private ReliefNT IPv6"
" calls. ``AF_INET6`` is 10 and ``sockaddr_in6`` is 28 bytes; addresses and ports use network byte "
"order, and ``sin6_scope_id`` is the interface index. Currently ``lo`` is 1 and ``eth0`` is 2. "
"Link-local addresses require the correct scope identifier."

msgid ""
"实现包含 UDP、TCP、ICMPv6 raw socket、回环、以太网 IPv6、邻居发现、重复地址 检测、路由器发现和 SLAAC。地址与默认路由按通告有效期维护；SLAAC 地址遵守 "
"RFC 4862 的两小时有效期保护。处理 IPv6 校验和、扩展首部、源端分片、乱序重组、 重叠分片拒绝及 Packet Too Big。IPv6 路由器不应在转发路径代替发送端分片。 "
"协议维护在可调度的任务上下文执行，不在原始中断中进行阻塞内存回收。"
msgstr ""
"The implementation includes UDP, TCP, ICMPv6 raw sockets, loopback, Ethernet IPv6, neighbor "
"discovery, duplicate address detection, router discovery, and SLAAC. Addresses and default routes "
"follow advertised lifetimes; SLAAC addresses observe RFC 4862's two-hour valid-lifetime "
"protection. IPv6 checksums, extension headers, source fragmentation, out-of-order reassembly, "
"overlapping-fragment rejection, and Packet Too Big are handled. IPv6 routers must not fragment on "
"the forwarding path on behalf of the sender. Protocol maintenance runs in schedulable task "
"context, without blocking memory reclaim in raw interrupt context."

msgid ""
"IPv6 socket 默认允许 IPv4 映射地址；应用可在绑定前使用 ``IPV6_V6ONLY`` 限制为 IPv6。``IPV6_RECVPKTINFO`` 和 "
"``IPV6_RECVHOPLIMIT`` 提供接收接口、 目标地址和 hop limit，便于实现标准协议客户端。保留 BusyBox 使用的旧版 hop-limit 辅助数据及 raw "
"ICMPv6 checksum/filter 选项。未知选项返回错误， 不能将未实现功能报告为设置成功。"
msgstr ""
"IPv6 sockets allow IPv4-mapped addresses by default; applications can restrict them to IPv6 using "
"``IPV6_V6ONLY`` before binding. ``IPV6_RECVPKTINFO`` and ``IPV6_RECVHOPLIMIT`` provide the "
"receiving interface, destination address, and hop limit for standard protocol clients. Legacy hop-"
"limit ancillary data and raw ICMPv6 checksum/filter options used by BusyBox are retained. Unknown "
"options return errors; unimplemented features must not report successful configuration."

msgid "配置与观测"
msgstr "Configuration and Observation"

msgid ""
"``AF_NETLINK`` / ``NETLINK_ROUTE`` 提供链路、地址和路由查询，IPv6 地址和路由 修改需要 ``CAP_NET_ADMIN``。支持链路、IPv6 "
"地址和路由变更订阅；接收队列 溢出报告 ``ENOBUFS``，调用者应重新查询。``getifaddrs()`` 可以通过标准查询 获取 IPv6 地址。保留 Linux IPv6 地址、路由 "
"ioctl，并根据 socket family 选择相应参数布局。"
msgstr ""
"``AF_NETLINK`` / ``NETLINK_ROUTE`` provides link, address, and route queries; changing IPv6 "
"addresses or routes requires ``CAP_NET_ADMIN``. Subscriptions cover link, IPv6 address, and route "
"changes. Receive queue overflow reports ``ENOBUFS`` and callers should query again. "
"``getifaddrs()`` can obtain IPv6 addresses through standard queries. Linux IPv6 address and route "
"ioctls are retained, with argument layouts selected by socket family."

msgid ""
"多部分查询的数据与 ``NLMSG_DONE`` 结束标记分开发送为数据报；结束标记保留 请求序号和接收端口 ID。即使查询没有数据，也会发送结束标记。接收方仍应遍历 "
"每个数据报内的全部消息，直到收到对应序号的 ``NLMSG_DONE`` 或错误。"
msgstr ""
"Multipart query data and the terminating ``NLMSG_DONE`` marker are sent as separate datagrams; the"
" marker retains the request sequence number and receiving port ID. A marker is sent even for an "
"empty query result. Receivers must still iterate all messages in each datagram until the matching "
"``NLMSG_DONE`` or an error arrives."

msgid ""
"``/proc/net/if_inet6``、``ipv6_route``、``tcp6``、``udp6``、``raw6`` 使用 Linux 文本布局；其中地址 scope 的编码与 "
"rtnetlink 的 scope 值不同。 快照复制出内部状态，不借出跨等待有效的内核指针。"
msgstr ""
"``/proc/net/if_inet6``, ``ipv6_route``, ``tcp6``, ``udp6``, and ``raw6`` use Linux text layouts; "
"address scope encoding differs from rtnetlink scope values. Snapshots copy internal state rather "
"than lending kernel pointers that remain valid across waits."

msgid "范围与标准"
msgstr "Scope and Standards"

msgid ""
"这是 IPv6 主机实现，不提供 IPv6 路由转发、IPsec、MLDv2 源特定组播过滤或 Redirect 路由更新。DNS 策略、RDNSS 和 DHCPv6 客户端属于用户态。接收和发送"
" 缓存有资源上限，资源不足返回错误；并不宣称覆盖 Linux 的全部网络功能或全部 IPv6 扩展。"
msgstr ""
"This is an IPv6 host implementation. It does not provide IPv6 routing/forwarding, IPsec, MLDv2 "
"source-specific multicast filtering, or Redirect route updates. DNS policy, RDNSS, and DHCPv6 "
"clients belong in userspace. Receive and send buffers have resource limits, and resource "
"exhaustion returns errors. No claim is made to cover all Linux networking features or all IPv6 "
"extensions."

msgid ""
"依据 RFC 8200、4291、4443、4861、4862、8201、3493、3542 以及 Linux ``ipv6(7)``、``rtnetlink(7)``。POSIX "
"规定应用接口，线上 IPv6 协议细节由 相应 IETF 标准规定。宿主定向测试与完整系统 VM 测试是不同证据；VMware 和 真实硬件结果不能由 QEMU 结果替代。"
msgstr ""
"Based on RFC 8200, 4291, 4443, 4861, 4862, 8201, 3493, and 3542, and Linux ``ipv6(7)`` and "
"``rtnetlink(7)``. POSIX specifies application interfaces; the corresponding IETF standards specify"
" IPv6 wire protocol details. Targeted host tests and full-system VM tests provide different "
"evidence; QEMU results cannot replace VMware or physical hardware results."
